[349.399, "yout cam\u001b[32G \u001b[34Gn within noise, so I'm\u001b[57Gdropping\u001b[66Git.\u001b[70GI'm\u001b[74Gnow\u001b[78Gdoing\u001b[84Gthree\u001b[90Gsmall,\u001b[97Gsafe\u001b[102Gchanges:\u001b[111Gsharing\r\u001b[1B  the embedding weights,\u001b[26Gresetting\u001b[36Gonly\u001b[41Gthe\u001b[45GKV\u001b[48Gpositions\u001b[58Gthe\u001b[62Glast\u001b[67Gcommand\u001b[75Gused,\u001b[81Gand\u001b[85Gwriting\u001b[93Glogits\u001b[100Gdirectly.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102mSearched for \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m pattern, read \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[3G\u001b[39mExisting tests still pass with bitwise-identical output, but the\u001b[68Gpartial\u001b[76Greset\u001b[82Gneeds\u001b[88Gits\u001b[92Gown\u001b[96Gtest:\u001b[102Gafter\u001b[108Ga\u001b[110Glong\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcommand then a short one, the cache must be all zeros and match\u001b[67Ga\u001b[69Gfresh\u001b[75Gprocess.\u001b[84GI'm\u001b[88Gwriting\u001b[96Gthat\u001b[101Gtest\u001b[106Gnext.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m\u23fa\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command\u2026\u001b[K\r\u001b[31C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m6\u001b[44G\u001b[38;2;157;157;157mthinking with high effort\u001b[39m\u001b[40;1H\u001b[38;3H"]
