[835.509, "\u001b[H\r\u001b[3C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102man \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m she\u001b[13Gl\u001b[15Gcommand \r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[39mThe long-contex\u001b[20Ganswers match, a\u001b[37Gd\u001b[39Gend-to-end dev timin\u001b[60Gs are w\u001b[69Ghin\u001b[73Gnoise\u001b[79Gbetween\u001b[87Gthe\u001b[91Gtwo\u001b[95Gversions.\u001b[105GI'm\u001b[109Gchecking\u001b[118Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bmemory\u001b[10Gsaving\u001b[17Gnext.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[39m Peak memory\u001b[15Gdropped\u001b[23Gfrom\u001b[28G705\u001b[32GMB\u001b[35Gto\u001b[38G534\u001b[42GMB\u001b[45G(\u221224%),\u001b[53Gmainly\u001b[60Gfrom\u001b[65Gremoving\u001b[74Gthe\u001b[78G98\u001b[81GMB\u001b[84Gembedding\u001b[94Gcopy\u001b[99Gand\u001b[103Glimiting\u001b[112Gthe\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B partial\u001b[11Greset\u001b[17Gto\u001b[20Gthe\u001b[24Gtouched\u001b[32Gpart\u001b[37Gof\u001b[40Gthe\u001b[44GKV\u001b[47Gcache.\u001b[54GFinal\u001b[60Gvalidation,\u001b[72Gthe\u001b[76Gprecision\u001b[86Gre-check,\u001b[96Gand\u001b[100Gthe\u001b[104Gsaved\u001b[110Gprofile\r\u001b[1B  come next.\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRan \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shell commands \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[39m Validation passed, and the GB/s drop to 54 looks like machine state rather than a regression, since the forward t"]
[835.51, "ime\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  matches the A/B at 8.25 ms. I'm updating NOTES.md next.\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[39m The script stopped at its second replacement before writing anything, so NOTES.md is unchanged. The wording I matched\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  against differs from the file. Reading the file's current text:\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRead \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[39m The file's wording differs from what I originally wrote, so other anchors may not match either. Reading the whole file\r\u001b[1B  before editing:\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRead \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[39m I have the exact text now. Applying the updates with targeted edits:\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m \u001b[39m \u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(NOTES.md)\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m\u273d\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;215;119;87mNewspa\u001b[38;2;245;149;117mper\u001b[38;2;215;119;87ming\u2026 \u001b[38;2;102;102;102m(13m 41s \u00b7 \u2193\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;102;102;102m43.4k t"]
