[889.034, "\u001b[H\u001b[3G \u001b[5Gunder memory pressure, which adds ~1 s to loading. A smaller\u001b[66Gmemory footprint i\u001b[90Gonly lever\u001b[101Gthere.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mKey cache:\u001b[22m each new key was written a\u001b[44G64\u001b[47Gvalues 4\u001b[56GKB apart.\u001b[66GStoring keys \u001b[81G blocks of 64\u001b[95Gpositions made\u001b[110Gkey\u001b[114Gstorage\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gplus attention 1.17\u00d7 faster\u001b[33Gat 40 positions, 1.21\u00d7\u001b[56Gat\u001b[59G80 and\u001b[66G1.59\u00d7 at 300, and no \u001b[88Gl\u001b[90Gwer at\u00a01000.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mChanges\u001b[11G\u001b[22m(all\u001b[16Gbitwise\u001b[24Gidentical):\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B1. The blocked key-cach\u001b[27G layout.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2\u001b[6GNo separate\u001b[18G98 MB embedding copy:\u001b[40Gtoken\u001b[46Glookups\u001b[54Gread\u001b[59Gthe\u001b[63Gtiled\u001b[69Gclassifier\u001b[80Ginstead.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3\u001b[6GThe reset clears only the positions the\u001b[46Gprevious command\u001b[63Gused.\u001b[69GThe cach\u001b[78G is \u001b[84Gill all-zero\u001b[97Gat\u001b[100Gthe\u001b[104Gstart\u001b[110Gof\u001b[113Gevery\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gcommand.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B4.\u001b[6GLOGITS writes\u001b[20Gits\u001b[24Garray\u001b[30Gdirectly,\u001b[40Gwithout\u001b[48Gan\u001b[51Gextra\u001b[57Gcopy.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mMeasured against the"]
